{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Yoga Yogi 是一款結合 90 天漸進式課程、語音教練與心情追蹤的瑜伽健身 App，適合初學者及有經驗的練習者按部就班建立力量、提升柔軟度與專注力。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-156.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>循序漸進瑜伽練習</h2>\n<p>課程以 90 天計畫安排每日瑜伽流程，分為初階、中階與進階三級，讓練習者按能力逐步解鎖挑戰。個人語音教練會引導呼吸與動作，練習時毋須一直看螢幕；每次練習前後可記錄心情，並在瑜伽學堂學習呼吸法、體式對齊與瑜伽哲學，另有徽章及連續練習記錄，介面簡潔專注。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-128-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Yoga Yogi</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/yoga-yogi/id6758276161?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:28:51.392644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:24.073148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:24.073148+00:00","content_hash":"c241c8999912ab16c15e24c89ef231a913ae77b09a0ccb9e978d45cc72e22f07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}